spice
* SPICE Netlist
* NMOS and PMOS models should be defined elsewhere in the library

* Transistors
M1A 3 5 9 5 PMOS
M2A 3 4 2 4 PMOS
M1 8 3 5 5 NMOS
M2 8 4 2 2 NMOS

* Current Sources
I1 7 3 DC I
I2 7 4 DC I
I3 6 8 DC 2I

* Capacitors
CL_left 9 5 CL
CL_right 2 2 CL
Cp_left 5 0 Cp
Cp_right 2 0 Cp

* Voltage Sources
VDD 7 0 DC VDD
VBB_left 5 3 DC VBB
VBB_right 4 2 DC VBB
VSS 0 6 DC VSS

.END